.subckt ClkG clkin p1 p2
*.ipin clkin
*.opin p1
*.opin p2
xn1 net2 clkin net1 VDD VSS sg13g2_nand2_2
xi2 clkinb clkin VDD VSS sg13g2_inv_2
xn2 net1 net2 clkinb VDD VSS sg13g2_nand2_2
xi3 p1 net2 VDD VSS sg13g2_inv_4
xi4 p2 net1 VDD VSS sg13g2_inv_4
.ends

